### Stage 8 · Figures

| Script | Owned artifacts |
|---|---|
| `figure_01_v04.py`           | `manuscript/figures/fig1_reserve_heatmap.pdf`, `manuscript/figures/fig3_share_trajectories.pdf` |
| `fig_event_timeline.py`      | `manuscript/figures/fig2_event_timeline.pdf` |
